Description: |
  Domain value objects for the manga aggregate: the entity, its cover/duplicate-detection
  projections, its partial-update counterpart, and a shared tri-state filter evaluator. This is
  the most widely-imported type set in the codebase — every repository, interactor, and
  presentation layer above the source boundary depends on Manga.
